  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Army Divisions",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the list of the Israelites—heads of families, commanders of thousands and commanders of hundreds, and their officers, who served the king in all that concerned the army divisions that were on duty month by month throughout the year. Each division consisted of 24,000 men.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In charge of the first division, for the first month, was Jashobeam son of Zabdiel. There were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was a descendant of Perez and chief of all the army officers for the first month.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In charge of the division for the second month was Dodai the Ahohite; Mikloth was the leader of his division. There were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The third army commander, for the third month, was Benaiah son of Jehoiada the priest. He was chief and there were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This was the Benaiah who was a mighty warrior among the Thirty and was over the Thirty. His son Ammizabad was in charge of his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fourth, for the fourth month, was Asahel the brother of Joab; his son Zebadiah was his successor. There were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fifth, for the fifth month, was the commander Shamhuth the Izrahite. There were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sixth, for the sixth month, was Ira the son of Ikkesh the Tekoite. There were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The seventh, for the seventh month, was Helez the Pelonite, an Ephraimite. There were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The eighth, for the eighth month, was Sibbekai the Hushathite, a Zerahite. There were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ninth, for the ninth month, was Abiezer the Anathothite, a Benjamite. There were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tenth, for the tenth month, was Maharai the Netophathite, a Zerahite. There were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The eleventh, for the eleventh month, was Benaiah the Pirathonite, an Ephraimite. There were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The twelfth, for the twelfth month, was Heldai the Netophathite, from the family of Othniel. There were 24,000 men in his division.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Leaders of the Tribes",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The leaders of the tribes of Israel:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "1CH 27:16"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "over the Reubenites: Eliezer son of Zikri;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "over the Simeonites: Shephatiah son of Maakah;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "over Levi: Hashabiah son of Kemuel;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "over Aaron: Zadok;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "over Judah: Elihu, a brother of David;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "over Issachar: Omri son of Michael;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "over Zebulun: Ishmaiah son of Obadiah;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "over Naphtali: Jerimoth son of Azriel;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "over the Ephraimites: Hoshea son of Azaziah;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "over half the tribe of Manasseh: Joel son of Pedaiah;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "over the half-tribe of Manasseh in Gilead: Iddo son of Zechariah;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "over Benjamin: Jaasiel son of Abner;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "over Dan: Azarel son of Jeroham.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "1CH 27:22"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf",
        "vid": "1CH 27:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "These were the leaders of the tribes of Israel.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David did not take the number of the men twenty years old or less, because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.27.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.27.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had promised to make Israel as numerous as the stars in the sky.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joab son of Zeruiah began to count the men but did not finish. God's wrath came on Israel on account of this numbering, and the number was not entered in the book",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of the annals of King David.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The King's Overseers",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azmaveth son of Adiel was in charge of the royal storehouses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jonathan son of Uzziah was in charge of the storehouses in the outlying districts, in the towns, the villages and the watchtowers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezri son of Kelub was in charge of the workers who farmed the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimei the Ramathite was in charge of the vineyards.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zabdi the Shiphmite was in charge of the produce of the vineyards for the wine vats.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baal-Hanan the Gederite was in charge of the olive and sycamore-fig trees in the western foothills.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joash was in charge of the supplies of olive oil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shitrai the Sharonite was in charge of the herds grazing in Sharon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shaphat son of Adlai was in charge of the herds in the valleys.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obil the Ishmaelite was in charge of the camels.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehdeiah the Meronothite was in charge of the donkeys.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaziz the Hagrite was in charge of the flocks.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf",
        "vid": "1CH 27:31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "All these were the officials in charge of King David's property.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathan, David's uncle, was a counselor, a man of insight and a scribe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehiel son of Hakmoni took care of the king's sons.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahithophel was the king's counselor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hushai the Arkite was the king's confidant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ahithophel was succeeded by Jehoiada son of Benaiah and by Abiathar.)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 27:34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joab was the commander of the royal army.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
